  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "熱"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>藍春瑞</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">6--月tsit站仔ê日--時lóng 35度hit跤兜，tio̍h-ài日頭落山，拖到beh暗仔7點外，天tsiah烏--來。打馬膠路、圍牆仔、紅毛塗壁ê燒lō、àu-hip tsiah沓沓仔無--去。若beh thìng候風吹--來有淡薄仔涼涼ê時tsūn，差不多mā ài peh-tsiūnn眠床--ah。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄-koh，房間有厝蓋、壁堵圍--leh，就準講代先kā門窗總開--開，到10點thóng仝款熱kah規身軀燒hut-hut，明明目睭to kiōng-beh he--去--ah，干干仔píng來píng去親像煎魚仔án-ne睏bē落眠。姑不而將就展一招討債銀票仔ê步數，kā冷氣送--落-去，電風koh放hōo se̍h，吹kah小可眠眠koh lio̍h-lio̍h仔涼涼ê時tsūn，tsiah翻身起來kā冷氣禁掉，kan-na留電風吹到天光。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">講是tsiânn熱ê日--時，若kan-na穿短褲tsat仔kah內衫踮厝內拍電腦、看報紙是拄好niâ，iáu ē堪--得，歹剃頭--ê是，便若出去外口做一屑仔割草、沃花ê穡頭，suah tio̍h先妝thānn kah好勢好勢，tsiah有法度穩心仔出門。Tse內底，穿長ńg是驚蠓叮；戴笠仔是beh tsa̍h日頭；穿靴管是bē giàn hōo蛇咬--著，一身khàm頭khàm尾包kah ba̍t-tsiuh-tsiuh tsiah hānn過戶tīng。上忝--ê是起跤行無幾步路，to未做著啥mih khang-khuè，規个人滿身重汗，tòo kah衫仔褲lóng kah肉黏做伙。Hit種艱苦真正m̄是三、兩句話就講ē清--ê。就準講ē清，一身包kah像肉粽，mā無法度做啥mih khang-khuè。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">M̄管偌燒熱，過晝若有thang落一tsūn仔西北雨，hōo塗跤ê柴樹仔、花草小可止喙ta--一-下，就差大kue̍h--ah。想是án-ne leh想，khah ē知影逐工lóng有雲尪leh「假雨意」，liam-mi烏liam-mi白，tī天頂尾溜夯kuân夯低，雨kan-na落bē來，一日到暗熱kah叫m̄敢。Koh-khah hiau-hīng--ê是園仔內根盤釘無夠深ê柴樹仔，直透lian葉落ue，kā塗跤uè kah滿滿是，sian掃to bē離。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熱--人bái bóng bái，iáu有兩項好空--ê。頭一項就是免hiânn gá-suh就有lâ-lûn燒ê水thang洗tn̄g，身軀、頭鬃lóng tâm-lok-lok ê時tsūn，衫就kā long--落-去，上無ài半點鐘tsiah ē ta--去，hit種透心涼tsiah是讚。第二項是規日àu鬱熱ê天氣，人就會tshiah-ia̍h，糜飯食bē落--去，tsit聲免khai錢就ē-tàng減肥，正經是「一兼二顧，摸蜊仔兼洗褲」。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\">（Tsit篇文章bat刊tī教育部電子報，漢羅用字有調整，原文網址：<a href=\"https://reurl.cc/YEGR40\" target=\"_blank\">https://reurl.cc/YEGR40</a>）</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><!--more--><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2jb4jQ6wTeIGQxOvb6cD0S2MozdpQpM4T3LXy2LhkWE4qQ50ndBDTRca7GdSN0RijlC8wXj8J_UygbLWtumrWCx6ckb16dbQ0Z5y4hRzDM4-U6JaXwLVNhN5-JwP1cuwQw3y0e8X2FIzYwDEI81GSq9BIDjAQjWw25t_sosNMyxhdI4XPPmcMl-ciKzFE/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2jb4jQ6wTeIGQxOvb6cD0S2MozdpQpM4T3LXy2LhkWE4qQ50ndBDTRca7GdSN0RijlC8wXj8J_UygbLWtumrWCx6ckb16dbQ0Z5y4hRzDM4-U6JaXwLVNhN5-JwP1cuwQw3y0e8X2FIzYwDEI81GSq9BIDjAQjWw25t_sosNMyxhdI4XPPmcMl-ciKzFE/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_20.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjWvkYBpV0IaavR3LvDRTATr9HVQr0GfRajcK8CNa72CetziYsuC22Ec_aPq-vwk26cTmW4YiaP8Igpbb6u6viqnuPuKmWSqmR6MvyfYc0bIpNBIx48gXlATpYV8nusNqR56Uc5RK5VKxcj9k0JoqQmrpx0dT3IgJUQCqXPVhMXL_lv4RyPcZY6TvsAxSfm/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1363%E6%9C%9F_21.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/A